son-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids shows July to August and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years. In 2025, November to December landed at 32% of normal on the middle of the grids, and so far in 2026 March to April sits at 42%. Grid 17289 had its driest year in 2016 at 56% of normal.</p>"}
